### Step 3: Deploy on Render with Your Secret Key
1. Go to **render.com**, sign in with GitHub, and click **New +** → **Web Service**[span_9](start_span)[span_9](end_span).
2. Select `hakaay-rss`[span_10](start_span)[span_10](end_span).
3. Set **Build Command** to `npm install` and **Start Command** to `node server.js`[span_11](start_span)[span_11](end_span).
4. Under **Environment Variables**, add `API_KEY` and paste your secret `ls_...` key there (never in the code files)[span_12](start_span)[span_12](end_span).
5. Click **Create Web Service**[span_13](start_span)[span_13](end_span).

